<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We need to be one with God in His history,</l><l>Moving and energizing in His loving overcomers;</l><l>We need to be one with God in His history,</l><l>Moving and energizing in His loving overcomers;</l><l>One with God in life, living, and all that we do today!</l><l>In Him! With Him! By Him! And for Him!</l><l>We need to be vital, living and active!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
